                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">FIRST RUN
1. Press ANALYZE. 2. Read Status and Info.
Cut removes voxels from the preview only, not the model.
To see inside: Cut=2, Fraction=0.5.
Scale=0 original geometry; Scale=1 actual displacement.
OPT: disable Results 3D preview and enable Shape.
